Canonical patch for .devin/agents/git.md - apply to every repo's
agent profile. Context: gate-blocked releases left cycle_log entries
with status=open that never closed after the downstream fix, and
verify_constraints flagged them as a false incident trail (incident
devin-telegram 2026-11-06).

The patch appends two bullets right after the existing rule
"Запись со status=open не переживает свой dispatch ..." in the
"Правила" section of .devin/agents/git.md. Applies with `patch`
when the context lines match verbatim; otherwise append the two
bullets manually.

IMPORTANT: the close mechanic relies on `cycle_log.sh close` - a
subcommand added to .devin/scripts/cycle_log.sh by this same
rollout. Apply TWO file changes together:
  1. .devin/agents/git.md          - the diff below
  2. .devin/scripts/cycle_log.sh   - REPLACE ENTIRE FILE with the
     canonical content at the bottom of this file (flock +
     tmp-file + atomic rename; `close` flips matching open
     records to closed in place; `append` unchanged).

--- a/.devin/agents/git.md
+++ b/.devin/agents/git.md
@@ -49,4 +49,29 @@
